# Ultra Sonos

Sonos speaker control via SoCo CLI.

## When to Use
 "Play music on Sonos", "Volume up", "Group speakers"

## Commands

```bash
# List speakers
sonos list

# Play/pause
sonos Living\ Room play
sonos Living\ Room pause

# Volume
sonos Living\ Room volume 40

# Group rooms
sonos Living\ Room group Kitchen

# Play favorite
sonos Living\ Room favorite "Jazz Radio"

# Night mode
sonos Living\ Room night_mode on
```
